<title>FRANCE: EU grants free-mkt wheat, barley and rye - traders.</title>
<headline>EU grants free-mkt wheat, barley and rye - traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday granted the following rebates to export free-market grain to non-EU countries, grain trade sources said.</p>
<p>			 Tonnage		Maximum rebate</p>
<p> Soft wheat	  198,900		18.00 Ecus/tonne</p>
<p> Barley		 95,500		31.50 Ecus/tonne</p>
<p> Rye		    22,000		31.99 Ecus/tonne</p>
</text>
